<h1>Community Guidelines</h1>
<p>BlogApp is built for thoughtful writing and respectful discussion. Please follow these guidelines when publishing and commenting.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Write original content or properly attribute sources.</li>
  <li>Be respectful — no harassment, hate speech, or personal attacks.</li>
  <li>Do not publish spam, misleading information, or illegal content.</li>
  <li>Respect copyright and intellectual property.</li>
  <li>Report content that violates these guidelines so our team can review it.</li>
</ul>
<p>Violations may result in content removal or account suspension.</p>
